              "instruction": "vēsavilō ā koṇḍa mīda paryāṭakulu ekkuvagā uṇṭāru. — In summer there are a lot of tourists on that hill.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *vēsavilō ā koṇḍa mīda paryāṭakulu ekkuvagā uṇṭāru.* — In summer there are a lot of tourists on that hill.]"
